========================================================================
                        Bochs x86 Emulator 2.6.9
========================================================================

<bochs:1> b 0x6969
<bochs:2> b 0x69d9
<bochs:3> c

Breakpoint 1, 0x00006969
1号进程在用户态运行

<bochs:4> sreg

ldtr:0x0038, dh=0x000082ff, dl=0xf2d00068, valid=1
tr:0x0030, dh=0x00008bff, dl=0xf2e80068, valid=1
gdtr:base=0x00005cc0, limit=0x7ff

LDTR = 0x0038
0x0038 >> 3 = 7
指向 GDT 中的 7 号描述符
该 LDT 描述符中的段起始地址为 0x00fff2d0
即 0xfff2d0
它指向 1 号进程的 ldt 数组

<bochs:5> c

Breakpoint 2, 0x000069d9
0号进程在用户态运行

<bochs:6> sreg

ldtr:0x0028, dh=0x00008201, dl=0xed700068, valid=1
tr:0x0020, dh=0x00008b01, dl=0xed880068, valid=1
gdtr:base=0x00005cc0, limit=0x7ff

LDTR = 0x0028
0x0028 >> 3 = 5
指向 GDT 中的 5 号描述符
该 LDT 描述符中的段起始地址为 0x0001ed70
即 0x1ed70
它指向 0 号进程的 ldt 数组